    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477766\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Teaching Mode of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477767\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/teaching-with-the-spirit?lang=eng\">Teaching with the Spirit</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477768\" id=\"p1\">taught them as one having <span class=\"key-word\">authority</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p29#p29\">Matt. 7:29</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477769\" id=\"p2\">he said unto them, Have ye not <span class=\"key-word\">read</span> what David did, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Matt. 12:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477770\" id=\"p3\">Why speakest thou unto them in <span class=\"key-word\">parables</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Matt. 13:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477771\" id=\"p4\">Ye do err, not knowing the <span class=\"key-word\">scriptures</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p29#p29\">Matt. 22:29</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477772\" id=\"p5\"><span class=\"key-word\">preaching</span> the gospel of the kingdom of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Mark 1:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477773\" id=\"p6\">entered into the synagogue, and <span class=\"key-word\">taught</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Mark 1:21</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477774\" id=\"p7\"><span class=\"key-word\">preached</span> the word unto them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Mark 2:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477775\" id=\"p8\">all these things are done in <span class=\"key-word\">parables</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Mark 4:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477776\" id=\"p9\">he began to <span class=\"key-word\">teach</span> them, that the Son of man, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">Mark 8:31</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477777\" id=\"p10\">they were astonished … for his word was with <span class=\"key-word\">power</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">Luke 4:32</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477778\" id=\"p11\">when Jesus <span class=\"key-word\">perceived</span> their thoughts, he answering said, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Luke 5:22</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477779\" id=\"p12\"><span class=\"key-word\">Tell</span> me therefore, which of them will love him most, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p42#p42\">Luke 7:42</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477780\" id=\"p13\">our heart burn within us, while he <span class=\"key-word\">talked</span> with us, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">Luke 24:32</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477781\" id=\"p14\">he whom God hath sent <span class=\"key-word\">speaketh</span> the words of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p34#p34\">John 3:34</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477782\" id=\"p15\">My <span class=\"key-word\">doctrine</span> is not mine, but his that sent me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">John 7:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477783\" id=\"p16\"><span class=\"key-word\">wrote</span> on the ground, as though he heard them not, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">John 8:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477784\" id=\"p17\">even as the Father said unto me, so I <span class=\"key-word\">speak</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p50#p50\">John 12:50</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477785\" id=\"p18\">He saith unto him the <span class=\"key-word\">third time</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">John 21:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477786\" id=\"p19\"><span class=\"key-word\">feel</span> the prints … that ye may know, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">3 Ne. 11:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477787\" id=\"p20\">I <span class=\"key-word\">bear record</span> of the Father … and the Holy Ghost beareth record, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">3 Ne. 11:32</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477788\" id=\"p21\"><span class=\"key-word\">prepare</span> your minds for the morrow, and I come unto you again, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">3 Ne. 17:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477789\" id=\"p22\">How be it that ye have not <span class=\"key-word\">written</span> this thing, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">3 Ne. 23:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477790\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p54#p54\">Matt. 13:54</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
    "footnotes": {}
